{'symbol': 'ABC', 'date': '2022-11-16 16:15:00', 'title': 'AMERISOURCEBERGEN ELECTS REDONDA MILLER, M.D., TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'CONSHOHOCKEN, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERISOURCEBERGEN CORPORATION (NYSE: ABC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED REDONDA MILLER, M.D., 56, AS A NEW INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023.'}